Prime,t],PiGuMax[M\[Eta]Prime,t],OnShellInnerBreakpoints[t]];OnShellPureInner[\
t_?NumericQ,y_?NumericQ]:=PubNInt1D[OnShellPureVBKernel[t,u,y],u,PiGuMin[M\
\[Eta]Prime,t],PiGuMax[M\[Eta]Prime,t],OnShellInvariantBreakpoints[]]; \
OnShellGGSpectrumSM[s_?NumericQ]:=If[0<=s<(M\[Eta]Prime-m\[Pi])^2,\
phasePrefactor[M\[Eta]Prime]*PubNInt1D[OnShellSMKernel[t,M\[Eta]Prime^2+m\[Pi]\
^2-t-s],t,GGtMin[M\[Eta]Prime,s],GGtMax[M\[Eta]Prime,s],\
OnShellFixedSBreakpoints[s]],0.];OnShellGGSpectrumDark[s_?NumericQ,y_?\
