piGammaMultiplicity*phasePrefactor[M\[Eta]Prime]*OnShellSMInner[t],0.];\
OnShellPiGammaSpectrumDark[t_?NumericQ,y_?NumericQ]:=If[m\[Pi]^2<=t<M\[Eta]\
